      <p>These Terms are governed by the laws applicable in Chihuahua, Chihuahua, Mexico, without limiting any mandatory consumer protections that apply to you. Questions about these Terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:contact@facware.com">contact@facware.com</a>.</p>
      <p class="legal-note">These product terms supplement the general <a href="https://www.facware.com/terms-of-service.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facware Terms of Service</a> where applicable.</p>
    </div>
